00:07:56.820 --> 00:08:09.940
Derek Meyer: that has come up in a lot of my discussions with our clients. A lot of the times, people try to build their own indexing models, and those indexing models are not reorg-aware, because this is kind of a new concept with blockchain technology.

53
00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:13.649
Derek Meyer: You have superior data availability.

54
00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:26.509
Derek Meyer: which, from a DBA perspective, that's something that doesn't exist outside of blockchain. You know, if your app goes down, you lose data, it's a problem. With a blockchain, you don't have that, and that's a big pro

