00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:29.009
Derek Meyer: In the blockchain category.

56
00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:49.079
Derek Meyer: one of the cons is you have to deal with reorgs, and you have these kind of premature commitments of state that later get ignored or invalidated, and so you need to be able to understand when does this happen, and how do I update my state downstack to ensure that my data warehouse and databases are all

57
00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:52.870
