00:13:56.180 --> 00:14:14.770
Derek Meyer: We've had a lot of success stories, specifically with substreams and fire hose, you know, 10,000 times faster indexing, 72,000 times faster indexing. So, you know, it's kind of a apples and oranges comparison, because parallel indexing is going to be so much faster than linear indexing.

